=== sg_test_rwbuf ===
USAGE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  sg_test_rwbuf [--addrd=AR] [--addwr=AW] [--help] [--quick] --size=SZ
      [--times=NUM] [--verbose] [--version] DEVICE
  sg_test_rwbuf DEVICE SZ [AW] [AR]


POSITIONALS (4) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  DEVICE
  SZ
  AW
  AR


FLAGS (8) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Where
-r, --addrd AR   extra bytes to fetch during READ BUFFER
-w, --addwr AW   extra bytes to send to WRITE BUFFER
-l, --help       output this usage message then exit
-q, --quick      output read buffer size then exit
-s, --size SZ    size of buffer (in bytes) to write then read back
-t, --times NUM  number of times to run test (default 1)
-v, --verbose    increase verbosity of output
-V, --version    output version then exit
